cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use trainnr, please cite the software; if you build on its
  results, please cite the paper under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "trainnr: identify, train, evaluate, gate and monitor robot policies"
abstract: >-
  A real-to-sim-to-real pipeline for robot policies: the robot's actuators
  are identified from its own telemetry into a content-hashed bundle,
  policies are trained on the identified model with measured
  randomization spans, evaluated with paired trials and exact intervals,
  gated against the deployment stack, and watched for drift. One MCP
  server, a desktop app and a Claude Code plugin.
authors:
